\[\left(\delta Z_{\pi}^{corrected~{}simu}\right)^{2}=\]

\[\left(\frac{\sigma_{Z}^{data}}{\sigma_{Z}^{simu}}\right)^{2}\left(\delta \left\langle Z_{\pi}^{simu}\right\rangle\right)^{2}+\left(\delta\left\langle Z _{\pi}^{data}\right\rangle\right)^{2}+\left(Z_{\pi}^{simu}-\left\langle Z_{ \pi}^{simu}\right\rangle\right)^{2}\left(\left(\frac{\delta\sigma_{Z}^{data}} {\sigma_{Z}^{simu}}\right)^{2}+\left(\frac{\sigma_{Z}^{data}}{\sigma_{Z}^{~{} simu}}\cdot\delta\sigma_{Z}^{simu}\right)^{2}\right) \tag{7.3}\]

